msgid ""
"`RecordEntity` gives the entity a generated `Long` ID field and convenient methods used later in this tutorial.\n"
"You can use Hibernate's `@Id` and `@GeneratedValue` directly if you prefer, or if you need a custom ID strategy; see xref:quarkus-data-hibernate.adoc#about-entity-identifiers[About entity identifiers]."
