msgid "Managed session"
msgstr "托管会话"

msgid ""
"The previous example of a Discount Service works, but it can be simplified.\n"
"Quarkus Data Hibernate supports a \"managed persistence context\" that tracks objects for you: Hibernate monitors every entity it loads, detects which fields changed, and generates the minimal SQL needed to keep entities synchronized with the database at commit time.\n"
"You do not need to track dirty objects, and lazy associations are fetched automatically when you access them."
msgstr ""

msgid "To use a managed session:"
msgstr ""

