msgid ""
"Everything you have seen in this guide is built on top of https://jakarta.ee/specifications/data/[Jakarta Data] and https://jakarta.ee/specifications/persistence/[Jakarta Persistence].\n"
"For more advanced scenarios, you can use these raw components directly.\n"
